Write a function spread4 that takes four unsigned 32-bit numbers a, b, c, d and returns, as an unsigned 64-bit number, 4 times the largest of them minus their sum. Put a, b, c, d in that order into a sequence of four unsigned 32-bit numbers; write and use a helper function max4(v) that returns the largest of the four values of v and a helper function sum4(v) that returns their sum as an unsigned 64-bit number.
